  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In an electrochemical reaction of lead, at standard temperature, if&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Pb</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mtext>&#160;Volt&#160;&#160;</mtext></math>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Pb</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Volt</mi><mo>,</mo></math>then the value of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>xn</mi></math>. The value of x is _______. (Nearest integer)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The relation between Gibbs Free energy and emf of the cell can be related as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>nFE</mi><mi>cell</mi></msub></math></p><p>The electrode reactions can be written as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><mi>Pb</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>FE</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Pb</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><mi>Pb</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi>FE</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Pb</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>FE</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>FE</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi>FE</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Pb</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>FE</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Pb</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Pb</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Pb</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math></p><p>Hence, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
